      "checkpoint": [
        "Route 6: Bug Catcher Keigo (3, 16) faces east, sight 5, over the middle path (4..8, 16); Bug Catcher Elijah (20, 25) faces west, sight 3, over the east path (17..19, 25). The way goes down column 15, through the grass to the wall (15, 33), out of both lines; the open leg west to it, a tile short, leaves the player on column 16, out of them too.",
