        "Picnicker Isabelle (13, 32) and Camper Jeff (13, 33) face west, sight 3, over (10..12, 32) and (10..12, 33); the only way south, (10..12, 34), is from Jeff's row. Up to (15, 31), west to the wall (7, 31), down to the wall (7, 33), east: Jeff is fought on the step onto (10, 33) and walks up to (11, 33). Isabelle's row is kept off.",
